// Per-org override of a staff role's default permission set (Salesforce-style role editing). When a
// row exists for (org, role), it REPLACES the global role_permissions default for users of that role
// in that org (resolved in PermissionsGuard). No row = the global seed default. Only the editable
// roles (hiring_manager/recruiter/panel) ever get a row — the API refuses the rest. Tenant-scoped
// (organization_id) -> RLS-paired migration. permissionsJson is a JSON string[] of permission keys,
// same shape as PermissionProfile.
